  "quality_flags": [
    {
      "flag_type": "unresolved_inconsistency",
      "slot": "main_flow",
      "detail": "[mainflow_postconditions_reachability] Postcondition 3 requires that for slaved ellipses, squares, and rectangles the Axis Orientation changes with the Related TN course change, but none of the main-flow steps defines or sets an Axis Orientation value. The area-definition steps set the descriptor, Square/Circle Switch, and major/minor axes, so postcondition 3 is not reachable from the stated main flow.",
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "flag_type": "unresolved_inconsistency",
      "slot": "trigger",
      "detail": "[mainflow_trigger_continuity] The trigger only covers slaved reference points/geometric areas defined relative to a Related TN (plus the ballistic-missile impact-point case). Main-flow step 6 introduces a J7.6 (ACT=1) slaved-filter scenario, including an independently moving filter where TN, Related is No Statement. That scenario is not a continuation of the stated trigger and no trigger/precondition alternative supports it, so the main flow restarts into a different scenario.",
      "evidence_refs": []
    }
  ],
