      ],
      "inconsistency_hints": [
        "Precondition 2 asserts that the delta position values have been established and the Slaved Indicator is already set to 1. Main flow step 1 and postcondition 2 treat establishing the deltas and setting the indicator as the result of the definition, so the precondition already contains the outcome of the use case.",
        "The trigger only states that identification of a ballistic missile track initiates definition of a slaved reference point (Impact Point). The main flow also defines slaved geometric areas (steps 3-5), but no trigger event is provided for that geometric-area path.",
        "Postconditions 3-5 describe J7.6 slaved-filter behavior ('TN, Related', Course/Speed, ACT=1, movement timing), but the main flow defines slaved points/areas via J3.0 messages and never mentions J7.6 or slaved-filter movement. The main flow therefore cannot lead to these postconditions.",
        "The main flow defines slaved points/areas via J3.0 word sequences and axis dimensions, but it contains no steps for setting 'TN, Related' to 'No Statement' with Course/Speed for independent movement and no step for transmitting the J7.6 (ACT=1) filter description report. Therefore the postconditions about independent slaved-filter movement and movement beginning at J7.6 transmission are not reachable from the main flow."
      ]
    }
  ],
